# Moddy Arena: the Champions board on the prep room's back wall. It shows the leaders at the settings on the control
# panel (Normal, 5 waves: a difficulty and a number of waves; the difficulty brings its monsters). His first run is lost on wave 3 (out of his 3 lives, by command): the board's
# first row is his face, his name, "Wave 3" and his time, and the control panel says his best. A better run (all 5
# waves won) replaces it; a worse one (lost on wave 1) does not. He changes the difficulty on the panel and the board
# switches to Easy's champions (none yet), then back. Monsters are removed by command.
# play-timeout: 1200
@intent after a run the Champions board shows his face, name, wave and time at those settings; a better run replaces the entry and a worse one does not; changing a setting switches the board
@world flat seed=1

@step he arrives; the board has no champions yet
@expect chat Welcome to Moddy Arena within 90s
@wait 2s
difficulty hard
difficulty normal
gamemode survival
effect give @s minecraft:resistance 1200 4 true
effect give @s minecraft:saturation 1200 0 true
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_champions_none,nbt={text:{text:"No champions here yet. Be the first!"}}]

@step a first run, lost on wave 3
@aim look 180 0
@key key.forward hold 8t
@wait 10t
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect chat A battle is starting within 5s
@expect title Wave 1 of 5 within 15s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 2 of 5 within 20s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 3 of 5 within 20s
@wait 1s
kill @s
@expect chat Knocked out! 2 lives left within 10s
@wait 2s
kill @s
@expect chat Knocked out! 1 life left within 10s
@wait 2s
kill @s
@expect chat no lives left within 10s
@expect chat Your run: Wave 3 in within 5s
@expect chat You are number 1 on the Champions board within 1s

@step the board shows him: his face, his name, wave 3 and his time
@wait 2s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_champions_rank_1,nbt={text:{text:"1."}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_champions_result_1,nbt={text:{text:"Wave 3"}}]
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_champions_name_1,nbt={text:{text:""}}]
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_champions_time_1,nbt={text:{text:""}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:item_display,tag=moddyarena_champions_face_1,nbt={item:{id:"minecraft:player_head"}}]
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:item_display,tag=moddyarena_champions_face_2]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_champions_none,nbt={text:{text:""}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_best]
@expect chat The arena is tidy again within 20s

@step a better run: all 5 waves won, and it replaces his entry
@wait 1s
teleport @s 0.5 64 19.5 180 0
@wait 10t
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect chat A battle is starting within 5s
@expect title Wave 1 of 5 within 15s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 2 of 5 within 20s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 3 of 5 within 20s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 4 of 5 within 20s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title BOSS WAVE within 20s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat You won the battle within 10s
@expect chat Your run: Won all 5 in within 3s
@wait 2s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_champions_result_1,nbt={text:{text:"Won all 5"}}]
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:item_display,tag=moddyarena_champions_face_2]
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_champions_rank_2,nbt={text:{text:"2."}}]
@expect chat The arena is tidy again within 20s

@step the picture: the board after his runs, from the middle of the room
@wait 1s
teleport @s 0.5 64 21.5 0 2
@wait 12s
@shot champions-after-runs

@step a worse run, lost on wave 1, does not replace it
teleport @s 0.5 64 19.5 180 0
@wait 10t
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect chat A battle is starting within 5s
@expect title Wave 1 of 5 within 15s
@wait 1s
kill @s
@wait 2s
kill @s
@wait 2s
kill @s
@expect chat no lives left within 10s
@expect chat Your run: Wave 1 in within 5s
@wait 2s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_champions_result_1,nbt={text:{text:"Won all 5"}}]
@expect chat The arena is tidy again within 20s

@step changing the difficulty switches the board to Easy's champions, and back
@wait 1s
teleport @s 0.5 64 18.5 180 0
@wait 10t
@aim pos -3.5 66.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect actionbar Difficulty: Easy within 3s
@wait 1s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_champions_settings,nbt={text:{text:"Easy, 5 waves"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_champions_none,nbt={text:{text:"No champions here yet. Be the first!"}}]
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:item_display,tag=moddyarena_champions_face_1]
teleport @s 0.5 64 21.5 0 2
@wait 12s
@shot champions-easy
teleport @s 0.5 64 18.5 180 0
@wait 10t
@aim pos -0.5 66.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect actionbar Difficulty: Normal within 3s
@wait 1s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_champions_settings,nbt={text:{text:"Normal, 5 waves"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_champions_result_1,nbt={text:{text:"Won all 5"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:item_display,tag=moddyarena_champions_face_1]
teleport @s 0.5 64 21.5 180 -2
@wait 12s
@shot panel-best-line
